  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger political and operational cohesion among allied states enables coordinated energy embargoes or stricter export controls that tighten global energy supply, directly lifting market expectations of future consumer‑price inflation.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
