  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher cohesion among Western allies on responses to the war enables coordinated regulatory actions (harmonized export controls, investment-screening and joint sanctions) that raise cross-border legal and compliance burdens on AI-related transactions with strategic competitors.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
