  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened regulatory and legal action against large AI firms increases uncertainty about earnings and credit quality for systemically important corporates, triggering sudden credit repricings and margin adjustments that elevate bond market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
</edge>
