  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in bond-market volatility raise margin and short-term financing costs for refiners and commodity traders, incentivizing inventory drawdowns to free cash and meet collateral calls, reducing refined fuel stocks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_turmoil</data>
  <data key="d40">energy_supply_shock</data>
