  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp net outflows from jurisdictions that host major exporters reduce FX liquidity and working capital for exporters and shipping firms, forcing delayed shipments or export curbs and thereby lowering physical energy supply flow to markets.</data>
