  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher commercial and strategic refined‑product inventories reduce the strategic payoff of attacking shipments or terminals, lowering incentives for actors to target flows and thus reducing the short‑term rate of oil‑flow disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_supply_shock</data>
