  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained higher energy prices raise operating costs for compute‑intensive AI startups and smaller firms, forcing scale‑backs or exits that increase revenue and platform share for large incumbents able to absorb or hedge the cost shock.</data>
